1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,352
It starts with one drop.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,124
High in the mountains, the cloud lets go.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,929
Roofs drink first. Then the stones. Then the stream.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,914
Somewhere below, one red umbrella is walking home.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,342
One lit window is enough.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,723
Rain, again. Stay a little longer.
